# Stroke caps & joins demo (v1.4)
#  - top: two strokes meeting at a right angle (round join via round caps)
#  - bottom left: square cap; bottom right: butt cap
v 0 80 60
v 1 180 60
v 2 80 160
e 0 0 1
e 1 0 2
s 0 0 E63946 22 22
s 1 1 E63946 22 22
v 3 260 140
v 4 360 140
e 2 3 4
s 2 2 2A9D8F 20 20 cap=square
v 5 260 220
v 6 360 220
e 3 5 6
s 3 3 F4A261 20 20 cap=butt
